The {{Term/Store|Desert Voe Set||Series, BotW, TotK}} is a recurring [[Armor Set]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK}}<ref name="CaC 183"/><ref name="TotK Piggyback 404"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Improve|January 2021}}
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Desert Voe Set is composed of the [[Desert Voe Headband]], the [[Desert Voe Spaulder]] and the [[Desert Voe Trousers]]. The full Desert Voe Set can be purchased for a total of 2,400 [[Rupee]]s from either the [[Gerudo Secret Club]] in [[Gerudo Town]] or from [[Rhondson Armor Boutique]] in [[Tarrey Town]].

Each piece in the Desert Voe Set offers a low-level [[Heat Resistance]] which can be combined to provide a maximum mid-level Heat Resistance. The Desert Voe Set yields a [[Shock Damage Resist]] [[Set Bonus]] when each piece is [[Enhancing|Enhance]]d twice by a [[Great Fairy]].

The Desert Voe Set can also be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] in [[Hateno Village]].

